    "summary": "Before the battle, at [Muster Armies](vsdata:core-rule/muster-armies), each **LEADER** or **SUPPORT** unit of yours can pick a **BODYGUARD** unit of yours that it [can lead](vsdata:core-rule/forming-attached-units). It then leads that unit, and together they form an [Attached unit](vsdata:core-rule/attached-units) for the battle.\n\nUnless a rule says otherwise, a **BODYGUARD** unit can have at most one attached **LEADER** unit and at most one attached **SUPPORT** unit.",
